DESCRIPTION:A celebration of football\, family\, and keeping the faith. Fra
 nk is forty and caring for his dad. Though times are tough\, they are both 
 lifelong Leicester City fans and about to witness the greatest sporting und
 erdog story of modern times. Win Loss Draw is a gig-theatre production tell
 ing the story of Leicester City's incredible English Premier League season 
 of 2015/16. Dealing with difficult themes\, but full of humour and heart\, 
 this is a dose of feelgood in dark times and a hymn to teams and supporters
  of all tribes and types.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/
 event/win-loss-draw/
